$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 3-(2,6-Difluoropyridin-4-yl)-1-(phenylsulfonyl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridine
(23). A suspension of
1-(phenylsulfonyl)-3-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridine
(0.360 g, 0.936 mmol), 2,6-difluoro-4-iodopyridine (0.205 g, 0.851 mmol),
dichlorobis(triphenylphosphine)palladium(II) (0.024 g, 0.034 mmol) and
aqueous sodium carbonate (1M, 0.681 mL, 0.681 mmol) in DME/EtOH/water
(7:2:3) (5.5 mL) was degassed and heated at 80°C for 3.5 hours. The
suspension was diluted with water and brine and extracted with EtOAc
(2x). The combined organic layers were dried over MgSO4, filtered,
concentrated, and purified on a 12 g column using the ISCO Companion
flash system eluting with CH2Cl2/hexane (7:3 to 9:1).
3-(2,6-Difluoropyridin-4-yl)-1-(phenylsulfonyl)-1H-pyrrolo[2,3-b]pyridine
(23) as light brown solids, yield 0.200 g, 63%. 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO) δ
7.44 (dd, J = 8.1, 4.8 Hz, 1H), 7.80-7.60 (m, 5H), 8.22-8.18 (m, 2H),
8.48 (dd, J = 4.7, 1.4 Hz, 1H), 8.54 (dd, J = 8.1, 1.4 Hz, 1H), 8.79 (s,
1H). MS (ESI) m/z 372.2 (M+H)+.
