$DATUM A mixture of
9-bromo-1-methyl-8-(trifluoromethyl)-3-((2-(trimethylsilyl)ethoxy)methyl)-3,5-dihydrobenzo[5,6][1,4]oxazino[3,4-c][1,2,4]triazin-2(1H)-one
(intermediate obtained at Step E during preparation of compound 28, 1 g,
2.03 mmol), bis(pinacolato)diboron) (1.03 g, 4.05 mmol), Pd(dppf)Cl2
(0.296 g, 0.405 mmol) and KOAc (0.496 g, 5.06 mmol) in dioxane (30 mL)
was stirred at 90 °C overnight. The reaction mixture was cooled to
ambient temperature and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified
by chromatography on silica gel (eluting with 50% EtOAc in petroleum
ether).
4-methyl-6-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-[1,3,2]dioxaborolan-2-yl)-7-trifluoromethyl-2-(2-trimethylsilanylethoxymethyl)-2,10-dihydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-3-one
(0.67 g, 61%) as a white solid. LC/MS (Table 1, Method 2) Rt = 1.59 min;
MS m/z: 563.8 [M+23]+.
