$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of
4-(1-(2-(4-methyl-1H-1,2,3-triazol-1-yl)ethyl)-4-(pyridin-3-yl)-1H-imidazol-5-yl)benzonitrile
(3) and
4-(1-(2-(4-methyl-1H-1,2,3-triazol-1-yl)ethyl)-4-(pyridin-3-yl)-1Himidazol-5-yl)benzamide
(25) A mixture of
4-(4-bromo-1-(2-(4-methyl-1H-1,2,3-triazol-1-yl)ethyl)-1H-imidazol-5-
yl)benzonitrile (18) (30 mg, 0.0840 mmol), Pd(PPh3)4 (5 mg, 0.004 mmol),
Na2CO3 (18 mg, 0.17 mmol), pyridin-3-ylboronic acid (13 mg, 0.110 mmol),
1,4-dioxane (1 mL) and water (1 mL) was heated to 140 °C in a Biotage
Initiator 2.5 Microwave for 30 min. The crude material was purified by
Isolute Flash SCX-2 column (100% MeOH to 2 M NH3 in MeOH) followed by
flash column chromatography (0-20% MeOH in CH2Cl2). 4-(1-(2-(4-
methyl-1H-1,2,3-triazol-1-yl)ethyl)-4-(pyridin-3-yl)-1H-imidazol-5-yl)benzonitrile
(3) as an offwhite solid (4.2 mg, 0.012 mmol, 14%, ≥90% purity) and
4-(1-(2-(4-methyl-1H-1,2,3-triazol-
1-yl)ethyl)-4-(pyridin-3-yl)-1H-imidazol-5-yl)benzamide (25) as a white
solid (16.8 mg, 0.0450 mmol, 54%, ≥90%). (3): m.p.: 69-74 °C; Rf = 0.7
(15% MeOH in CH2Cl2); 1H NMR (500 MHz, MeOD) δ 8.40 (1H, dd, J = 1.0,
2.0, Hz, ArH), 8.35 (1H, dd, J = 1.5, 5.0 Hz, ArH), 7.85 (2H, dat, J =
1.5, 1.5, 8.0 Hz, 2 x ArH), 7.75 (1H, s, ArH), 7.73 (1H, ddd, J = 1.5,
2.0, 8.0 Hz, ArH), 7.45 (1H, d, J = 1.0 Hz, ArH), 7.42 (2H, dat, J = 1.5,
1.5, 8.0 Hz, 2 x ArH), 7.33 (1H, ddd, J = 1.0, 5.0, 8.0 Hz, ArH),
4.51-4.55 (4H, m, 2 x CH2),2.23 (3H, d, J = 1.0 Hz, CH3) ppm; 13C NMR
(126 MHz, MeOD) δ 148.5, 148.4, 144.6, 140.4, 136.8, 136.5, 134.9, 2 x
134.3, 2 x 132.8, 131.5, 129.6, 125.1, 123.9, 119.1, 114.2, 49.8, 46.4,
10.4 ppm; IR (solid) 2925, 2229, 1610, 1504, 1365, 847, 710, 575 cm-1;
LCMS (Fast4min) tr = 1.46 min, m/z 356 [M + H]+; purity (AUC) = 83%; HRMS
(ESI) m/z calcd for C20H17N7Na [M + Na]+ 378.1438, found [M + Na]+
378.1432. (25): m.p.: 105-110 °C; Rf = 0.2 (15% MeOH in CH2Cl2); 1H NMR
(500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.43 (1H, dd, J = 0.5, 2.0 Hz, ArH), 8.32 (1H, dd, J =
1.5, 5.0 Hz, ArH), 8.00 (2H, dat, J = 1.5, 1.5, 8.5 Hz, 2 x ArH), 7.75
(1H, ddd, J = 1.5, 2.0, 8.0 Hz, ArH), 7.71 (1H, s, ArH), 7.46 (1H, d, J =
0.5 Hz, ArH), 7.35 (2H, dat, J = 1.5, 1.5, 8.5 Hz, 2 x ArH), 7.30 (1H,
ddd, J = 1.0, 5.0, 8.0 Hz, ArH), 4.53-4.55 (2H, m, CH2), 4.49-4.52 (2H,
m, CH2), 2.25 (3H, d, J = 1.0 Hz, CH3) ppm; 13C NMR (126 MHz, CDCl3) δ
171.2, 148.2, 148.1, 144.6, 140.0, 136.2, 135.9, 133.5, 2 x 132.0, 131.8,
130.4, 2 x 129.8, 125.0, 123.9, 121.8, 51.2, 46.3, 10.4 ppm; IR (solid)
2921, 2854, 2190, 2170, 1668, 1614, 1374, 781, 711 cm-1; LCMS (Fast4min)
tr = 1.06 min, m/z 374 [M + H]+; purity (AUC) > 95%; HRMS (ESI) m/z calcd
for C20H19N7NaO [M + Na]+ 396.1543, found [M + Na]+ 396.1545.
